WEBVTT

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.730
Far, far away, in a distant time.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.740
In the outer space of this universe
there were people who called themselves

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.620
"the Tribe of Gold."

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:35.210
They, who created planets and
had the power to foresee the future,

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:39.080
called out to the still-primitive other tribes.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.010
"Come forth," they said.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:48.800
"From the planets you
were born on, out into space."

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:55.930
Three tribes responded to their call.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:01:01.320
The Tribe of Gold called them...

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.980
the Tribe of Silver,

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:09.160
the Tribe of Bronze,

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.710
and the Tribe of Hero.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:29.430
Before long, when the Tribe of Gold decided

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:34.310
to leave this universe for another universe,

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:38.440
a tribe that newly
answered their call emerged.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:54.580
The fourth tribe that came out
into space on its own power

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:56.620
Humankind.

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:17.140
The Tribe of Gold named them

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:20.940
the Tribe of Iron.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.600
I feel it...

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:58.140
I feel it for sure... It's ahead.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.420
Dhianeila-sama.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:33.380
I feel it. Our destination is growing near.

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.050
Then...

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:38.890
Please prepare for the declaration, Aneasha.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:01.750
It's already been two cycles
since we got off the starway.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.580
It feels like I've been wandering in circles.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:09.750
The Argonaut is cruising with -0.3
points margin of error, Master.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.510
I'm just talking about
how I feel, Bee no Bee.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:16.340
There's no way we'd be
wandering around with no supplies.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:18.970
Captain Mobeedo, the Food Division has

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.770
released the self-supply ratio for this cycle.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.770
The Health and Labor Division has submitted

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:26.350
the joule estimation for this cycle.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:29.360
The Bridge Committee should
deliberate all items within 20 hours.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.940
The Bridge Committee has
voted to request a day off.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:39.660
They can go to sleep after the
budget deliberation, those morons!

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:46.080
What if the deliberations fell behind
schedule and there was a food riot or something?

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:48.500
This ship would turn into a
ghost ship before you know it!

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:52.550
Our current food stockpile
is at more than 15%, Master.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:53.420
That's not enough!

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.090
We are unable to return to the starway

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:58.760
and we don't even have
a clear view of our destination!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:02.970
Finding a lost ship from 60 cycles
ago is an extremely reckless act.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.060
But my programming to ensure
humankind's right to existence

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:09.100
indicates this is
absolutely imperative, Master.

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.230
This only means that we've
been forced to draw the short straw

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.900
in a battle situation that's become so bad
we have no choice but to rely on the legend.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:19.410
I would do anything to
secure the throne for the princess,

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.780
if only she were willing...

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:25.250
You have a transmission from Dhianeila-sama.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:29.170
She said to come to the
briefing room immediately.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:33.630
Bee no Bee, what's the probability
that the princess wants to go home?

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:37.590
A figure virtually identical to zero, Master.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.970
Is that so...

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.610
So you have finally found the planet?

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.650
Yes, Iolaous.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.910
Stop right there.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:04.660
Men can't get any closer to her, Iolaous.

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.710
Congratulations, Dhianeila-sama.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:14.840
We're currently searching in the
direction suggested by the princess.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:15.500
Bee.

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:19.470
The analysis on the Atlas waveform is
completed. I'll now project the image.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.350
Is that a... planet?

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:35.610
To think it really exists in a space
where there's not even a starway...

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.940
That is the ruined planet, Olone.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:43.320
The planet which holds the
man who will be our savior.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.960
Thank you for the food!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.260
Age is back, Mom!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.060
Return of crew member confirmed.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:52.640
Approving onboard
activity according to Code 04.

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:56.860
Check this out, Mom.
Age has a Fuuto leg!

00:07:56.940 --> 00:08:01.280
The order requested is invalid.
Please repeat it carefully.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:04.450
It's a big leg. If Age
eats it a little bit at a time,

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.820
it'll last until the next
time the clouds come, for sure.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.460
It's ready, Mom.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:17.290
Operation order accepted.
Beginning processing the materials.

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.390
It tastes good, Mom.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.770
The code is invalid.

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.650
We've had no rain,
even when the clouds come lately.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:41.360
The code is invalid.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.150
The sun must've eaten
too many clouds, that's the problem.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.740
When Age eats too many of Fuuto's legs,

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:48.870
they don't come back out for a while.

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.410
Do you think so, too, Mom?

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:55.000
The question is invalid.
Please repeat it carefully.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:59.290
Better thank Fuuto.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:05.420
Thank you for growing big.

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:23.980
Thank you for letting Age
eat you all the time, Fuuto!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.500
Aligning with the orbit of the planet.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.420
I know it was expected,

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.250
but to think the princess would
go down to the planet herself...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.670
The preparations for all the Organ units that
are scheduled to descend have been completed.

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.260
If anything happens,

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:53.930
be sure you bring
the princess back safely, Iolaous.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.970
I know, Father.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.650
The princess is now going to descend!

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:08.700
Everyone, be sure to live up to
the reputation of the Yunos Knights!

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:12.740
Course clear. Bay opening.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.780
Basilis, taking off.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:18.200
Releasing the mooring clamp.
You're cleared for takeoff.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.250
Engine ignition. Take off.

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:24.250
Basilis separated from the main ship.

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.630
Course clear.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:35.970
Maybe that's the people Dad
and the others were talking about...

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:39.520
If so, Age will have to
say good-bye to you, Fuuto.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.610
Are these meteorite craters?

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.030
On a planet that's been
ruined to this extent...

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.070
can people really survive?

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.990
Even we could survive in this atmosphere.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:11:00.410
The solar radiation here is within
acceptable levels, though just barely.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.960
I feel a presence of some sort.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:11.050
Dhianeila-sama has designated the route!
All descending forces, change course!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.430
The person is here.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:19.640
The Tribe of Gold 
the wisest of all in this universe...

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:24.310
And he's the only human raised by them...

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:27.690
Is that some kind of signal?

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:30.860
A ship?

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.010
There's no doubt about it.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:12:00.270
The SOS code that's more than 1 20 years old...

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:05.560
No sign of life or movement detected, huh?

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:09.650
Iolaous, the Lotus Unit will go
ahead and begin the investigation.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.280
Will they be okay?

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:14.780
Just in case, I'll send
Tail and Mail as well.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:15.950
Roger that.

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:17.620
I'll be on patrol.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.790
Did they actually try to plant trees here?

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:27.330
It's pointless to do that in the desert.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.960
You think there's something here, Mail?

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.840
The princess says there is, Tail.

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:45.640
Intruders detected. Restricting
activities according to Code 03.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.600
It's still operational.

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:50.150
Let's fix it up a little.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.050
I see the ship's record.

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:15.420
I'll send it to the Argonaut.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.680
What, Tail?

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.140
What, Mail?

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.100
You just poked me, didn't you?

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:27.100
No, I didn't do anything.

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:05.060
I've detected many objects
approaching along the Argonaut's course!

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.100
Hurry up and put them on the screen!

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.230
The Tribe of Bronze?

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.020
S-Stay back!

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.400
Stop!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.290
Why?

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.080
A human?

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:36.920
Something is preventing us from getting
a readout. Is he protected by something?

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:41.180
I don't sense any hostility from him.

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:43.890
I will talk to him.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:46.970
Princess!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:52.230
We apologize for our sudden intrusion.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:55.860
We didn't come here to
seize your home by any means.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:57.980
We are humankind.

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:01.990
The ones the Tribe of Gold
named "Tribe of Iron."

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:05.370
With the aid of the message
given to us by the Tribe of Gold,

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:09.160
we have traveled here,
hoping to find the great being.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.160
Please tell me,

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:15.420
where can I find the great being
who possesses the Tribe of Hero within?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.130
A-g-e.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.170
What?

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:22.510
Nice to meet you, humankind!

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.840
He talked!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.640
Enemy is coming, Iolaous!

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:30.930
Raising the top deck.
 All personnel to emergency battle stations!

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:34.060
The top deck will be
repositioned to the battle bridge!

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:37.520
Section managers, prepare
to transfer the floor plates!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.780
Linkage of the plates completed.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:48.120
Floor plate, ascending to the
isolated area on the rooftop.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.240
Floor plate, reposition completed.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.450
Closing the isolating
partitions on the rooftop.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:55.580
Closing the tactics floor.
Executing emergency control system.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.090
Scatter oboronas!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.460
Ready to fire the main
batteries on the port side!

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.150
A Hedron shield?

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:17.610
Switch to rapid fire!

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:21.110
5th and 6th Organ Units, ready to move out!

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:24.490
Form a defensive line on
the Argonaut's orbit track!

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:27.370
They're coming!

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.130
Hurry! This way!

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.380
Closing the hatch. Take off immediately!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.760
We can't! We can't leave him!

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:53.640
They're here.

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:03.990
That's a reconnaissance ant!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.740
You two, come with me!

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:07.990
We're going to move!

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:19.920
It sent out a signal!

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:36.020
Mom!

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:42.520
Run!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.130
Strike the ones with
teleporting abilities first!

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.590
They're going to cover the sky!

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:05.250
The airspace is blocked!

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:07.300
Advance toward two o'clock!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:12.890
Mom!

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.190
Dhianeila-sama?

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.900
He is...

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:45.040
How could they have come
between the princess's ships?

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.880
Go as low as possible and rescue the princess!

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:50.760
An enormous object is approaching rapidly!

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.970
The entire ant heap is coming at us!

00:18:55.060 --> 00:18:56.390
Get the princess quick!

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:58.930
They'll eat us alive, along with the Argonaut!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:05.610
Take Dhianeila-sama to the escape pod.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.110
I'll take her back to the Argonaut.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:13.530
Dhianeila-sama, you must get out of here now.

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:14.910
I feel it.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:20.000
Dhianeila-sama!

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:29.300
The great being...

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:05.630
What is that?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.790
Withdraw at full speed!
Disengage alignment with the planet!

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:52.300
A large amount of energy was detected
coming from the surface of the planet!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:54.340
It's broken through the atmosphere!

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:55.380
Wha ?!

00:21:57.030 --> 00:22:00.610
All the ants are running away...

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:01.990
What's that?

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:15.960
The last Nodos...

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:31.980
The lone human who
possesses the Tribe of Hero within...

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:42.280
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:49.830
l never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:49.920 --> 00:22:55.210
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:55.300 --> 00:23:05.760
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:23:05.850 --> 00:23:17.650
l take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:29.790
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:34.830
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:41.550
That I love you

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:48.560
The person that we encountered
with the aid of the stars was...

00:23:48.640 --> 00:23:53.600
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 2: "The Forgotten Child."
